The '''{{Zone|Burning Desert}}''' is a large area on the {{Zone|Crimson Isle}}.

{{ZoneText|Visit &2Dragontail&f.|Collect Red Sand.|Survive the wildlife.}}

== Location ==
The location features a {{Item|Red Sand}} desert, with boulders and small lava pools. The {{Item|Skeleton Fish}} [[Trophy Fish]] can exclusively  caught from {{Skl|Fishing}} from lava there. {{MobSprite|Magma Cube Rider}}s and {{MobSprite|Flaming Spider}}s naturally spawn in the '''{{Zone|Burning Desert}}'''.

